<title>USA: National City Bancorp votes stock dividend.</title>
<headline>National City Bancorp votes stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>National City Bancorp said Monday its board voted a 10 percent stock dividend to be paid June 5 to holders of record as of May 5.</p>
<p>National City Bancorp is a bank holding company that owns National City Bank of Minneapolis and Diversified Business Credit Inc.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
